OL,3,GNEWSAMan who tried to kill partner with
OL,4,Ahammer jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who left his partner with
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries when he
OL,8,Fattacked her with a hammer has been
OL,9,Fjailed for 18 years.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said Shaquel
OL,12,FKerr delayed seeking medical attention
OL,13,Ffor his victim after attacking her at
OL,14,Fan address in East Leake,
OL,15,FNottinghamshire, on 31 March, making
OL,16,Fanother call before ringing 999.
OL,18,FThe woman, who was rushed to hospital
OL,19,Fby paramedics, had sustained a bleed on
OL,20,Fthe brain and multiple fractures to her
OL,21,Fskull, face and spine, the force added.
