OL,3,GNEWSAMan who tried to kill partner with
OL,4,Ahammer jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FKerr, 30, of Pamela Road in Birmingham,
OL,7,Fwas found guilty of attempted murder by
OL,8,Fa jury at Nottingham Crown Court on 24
OL,9,FSeptember and returned for sentencing
OL,10,Fon Friday.
